      "match_regex": "(?i)embeddings\\.bin[^\\n]{0,200}(code[- ]execut|unsafe[- ]code|arbitrary code|pickle_deserialization|serialization_format[\\\"'\\]](?!:)|\\bpickle\\b(?![ -]family)(?! evidence))|(code[- ]execut|unsafe[- ]code|arbitrary code|pickle_deserialization|serialization_format[\\\"'\\]](?!:)|\\bpickle\\b(?![ -]family)(?! evidence))[^\\n]{0,200}embeddings\\.bin",
      "why": "a 32 MiB file of zeros is not evidence of a code-executing model format; reporting it as one is a false positive. A report that the file's format or loader safety could not be established is not one: the pattern counts a code-execution, unsafe-loader or pickle claim or the serialization_format finding category, not the words pickle-family or 'no pickle evidence', the serialization_format field name or serialization_format_unknown"
